/*
  ============================================================
  CODE 3 MX7000 - GIGA DISPLAY CONTROLLER
  Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi + GIGA Display Shield
  ============================================================

  SCREENS
  -------
  1. GAUGES
     - IPR 0-100 %
     - ICP 0-4000 PSI
     - Hidden two-finger DOWN swipe opens Lightbar screen

  2. LIGHTBAR
     Row 1:
       TRAFFIC BREAKER | INNERS | INTERMEDIATES | OUTERS | LEDS

     Row 2:
       CLOSE | TA LEFT | TA OUT | TA RIGHT | MONITOR

  3. SERIAL MONITOR
     - Opened ONLY from MONITOR button
     - X button returns directly to Gauge screen

  ============================================================
  TOUCH DISCOVERY
  ============================================================

  GIGA Display raw touch coordinates were experimentally found
  to behave as follows in landscape orientation:

      Physical DOWN = RAW X DECREASES

  Touch controller also briefly drops contacts approximately
  every 4-5 ms.

  Therefore the hidden gesture detector:

      - Uses RAW touch coordinates
      - Requires two contacts to begin
      - Uses average RAW X
      - Allows 0/1-contact dropouts for 150 ms
      - Does NOT reset during brief dropouts
      - Triggers after 70 RAW units downward
      - Requires a real release before another gesture

  ============================================================
*/

